<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>From the house, from the house flows this living stream,</l><l>From the house, to the earth, with the life supreme.</l><l>Yet more deep, Lord, we seek that the flow may be;</l><l>Thus we must be measured and possessed by Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Measure us, measure us, measure every day;</l><l>Measure us, measure more, measure all the way,</l><l>Till we know that the flow is a mighty flood,</l><l>Sweeping over all the earth for Christ the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Take us through, take us through, take us through the flow;</l><l>Take us through, through and through, everywhere we go.</l><l>Flow increase, never cease, till we swim in Thee,</l><l>Till we are immersed in God eternally.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All shall live, all shall live where the river comes;</l><l>All shall live, really live, everywhere it runs.</l><l>Let the fount from this mount life abundant bring,</l><l>Till the deserts of the earth with churches spring!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
